  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ebola Recovery and Reconstruction Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to provide flexible financing for Africa to respond to the economic and social impacts across sectors, including supporting the building of resilient health systems, in light of the unprecedented Ebola outbreak in Africa.  The focus is on both the immediate and longer-term responses at the country level (including through regional action) and targeted to multiple sectors and purposes.</narrative>
  </description>
